di iPhone e offra funzioni come Duo FaceTime, mancano alcune caratteristiche chiave viste su iPhone 18 Pro e iPhone 18 Pro Max.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/iphone-duo-hero-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-duo-hero\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null}],\"totalPages\":85,\"pagesConsumed\":1},\"offerte\":[{\"id\":17484,\"date\":\"2026-09-06T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-06T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"alogic-amplia-gamma-display-5k-6k-e-nuovi-accessori\",\"title\":\"Alogic amplia la gamma display con nuovi modelli 5K e 6K e lancia nuovi accessori\",\"excerpt\":\"Alogic annuncia nuovi monitor Aspekt, Clarity e Vision con risoluzioni 5K/6K, funzioni touch e docking integrato, oltre a una nuova dock Thunderbolt 5 FlashDock 5 e nuove periferiche in arrivo.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/alogic-aspekt-displays-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"alogic-aspekt-displays\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17411,\"date\":\"2026-09-03T12:02:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-09-03T10:02:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-1-hatfield-asta-stima-fino-a-800mila-dollari\",\"title\":\"Apple-1 “Hatfield” funzionante in asta: stima fino a 800.000 dollari\",\"excerpt\":\"Un Apple-1 originale funzionante, noto come “Hatfield” (numero 48 della registry), potrebbe raggiungere 800.000 dollari in un’asta prevista a ottobre.\",\"categoryName\":\"Offerte\",\"categorySlug\":\"offerte\",\"categoryId\":501,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/09/hatfield-apple-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"hatfield-apple-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"